{
  "abstract": "This action amends Jet Routes J-26, J-64, and J-181, and Very High Frequency Omnidirectional Range (VOR) Federal Airways V-10 and V- 156; and revokes VOR Federal Airway V-262. The FAA is taking this action due to the planned decommissioning of the VOR portion of the Bradford, IL (BDF), VOR/Tactical Air Navigation (VORTAC) navigational aid (NAVAID). The Bradford VOR is being decommissioned in support of the FAA's VOR Minimum Operational Network (MON) program.",
